WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Old man, if you keep talking nonsense

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
When you arrive at the government office, be careful and wait for severe punishment

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Zhao Bantou, don’t talk to him anymore.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,060
Take it back and let Mr. Gospel make the decision.

5
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:17,090
What are you doing?

6
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:20,090
Since you are an eyewitness, you will naturally have to appear in court.

7
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:22,950
Come with us

8
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,660
Fourth uncle, tell me the truth

9
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:33,180
Was it the Bai family son who killed my little sister?

10
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:37,430
Hu Zi'er is the one killed by the Bai family's son.

11
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:43,410
Old man, are you talking about other people's money?

12
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:47,410
What nonsense are you talking about? I, Zhao Laosi, am telling the truth.

13
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:49,410
No one ever gives me money
